{
	"title": "Intercaler une fraction décimale",
	"description": "Écrire une fraction comprise entre deux dixièmes consécutifs (14/10 < 145/100 < 15/10) ; toute fraction strictement entre les deux est juste",
	"grades": ["CM1"],
	"theme": "Fractions",
	"domain": "Apprivoiser",
	"subdomain": "Encadrer",
	"level": 4,
	"delay": 45,
	"status": "draft",
	"options": {
		"constraints": {
			"reducedFractions": "off"
		}
	},
	"variations": [
		{
			"statement": "Écris une fraction décimale comprise entre ces deux fractions.\n\n$$\\frac{{{a}}}{10} < ? < \\frac{{{eval:a+1}}}{10}$$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "1..49"
				}
			],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "\\frac{{{eval:10*a+5}}}{100}",
					"requiredForm": "fraction",
					"rulesSuffice": true,
					"validationRules": [
						{
							"type": "range",
							"min": "{{eval:a/10;d}}",
							"max": "{{eval:(a+1)/10;d}}",
							"inclusive": false
						}
					]
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"**En centièmes.** $\\frac{{{a}}}{10} = \\frac{{{eval:10*a}}}{100}$ et $\\frac{{{eval:a+1}}}{10} = \\frac{{{eval:10*a+10}}}{100}$.",
					"Entre les deux, il y a neuf centièmes : $\\frac{{{eval:10*a+1}}}{100}$, $\\frac{{{eval:10*a+2}}}{100}$… jusqu'à $\\frac{{{eval:10*a+9}}}{100}$. Par exemple :",
					"$$\\frac{{{a}}}{10} < \\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{\\frac{{{eval:10*a+5}}}{100}} < \\frac{{{eval:a+1}}}{10}$$"
				]
			}
		}
	],
	"testSpecs": [
		{
			"description": "14/10 < 145/100 < 15/10",
			"variationIndex": 0,
			"variables": {
				"a": "14"
			},
			"answers": ["\\frac{145}{100}"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "correct"
			}
		},
		{
			"description": "14/10 < 141/100 < 15/10",
			"variationIndex": 0,
			"variables": {
				"a": "14"
			},
			"answers": ["\\frac{141}{100}"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "correct"
			}
		},
		{
			"description": "14/10 < 1450/1000 < 15/10",
			"variationIndex": 0,
			"variables": {
				"a": "14"
			},
			"answers": ["\\frac{1450}{1000}"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "correct"
			}
		},
		{
			"description": "14/10 < 29/20 < 15/10 (pas décimale, juste)",
			"variationIndex": 0,
			"variables": {
				"a": "14"
			},
			"answers": ["\\frac{29}{20}"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "correct"
			}
		},
		{
			"description": "Erreur : 15/10 (borne)",
			"variationIndex": 0,
			"variables": {
				"a": "14"
			},
			"answers": ["\\frac{15}{10}"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "incorrect"
			}
		},
		{
			"description": "Erreur : 145/10",
			"variationIndex": 0,
			"variables": {
				"a": "14"
			},
			"answers": ["\\frac{145}{10}"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "incorrect"
			}
		},
		{
			"description": "Forme : 1,45 (écriture à virgule)",
			"variationIndex": 0,
			"variables": {
				"a": "14"
			},
			"answers": ["1.45"],
			"expected": {
				"status": "bad_form",
				"constraintViolations": ["form"]
			}
		}
	]
}
